# Read by docker only from the build-context root, so this lives at the
# repository root: artifacts/Dockerfile and heyosecret/Dockerfile are built
# with the whole repository as context (each crate includes the shared
# `ui/ui.rs` by relative path), and a per-crate .dockerignore would never be
# consulted.
#
# target/ is multi-gigabyte per crate and the builder stage recompiles anyway;
# sending it as build context would dominate the build time.
**/target
.git
**/node_modules
